Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep runnin' along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch as we pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As we raise our flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, here we go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sailing through the endless ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody has ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep\Nbelieving in our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And let our heart lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All there's left is to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll link our hearts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.14,0:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Still raising our flag as we journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't back down from anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams\Nwhile keeping the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.60,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep heading for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase.\NLet's start up the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.64,0:01:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes,\Nwhat we'll have to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.58,0:01:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories will stay in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hello! Damn, too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk oh wait a second right it doesn't\Nmatter since i know where they're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All i gotta do is head to the gates of\Njustice and i'll catch them in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.88,0:02:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you save me\Nthe trouble of cutting
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you down you have the key\Nor not don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have been a\Nbit of a disappointment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,back at the galley law\Nmansion but i expect to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,be Entertained this time\Nif you pirates could
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,make it this far then\Nyou're far more capable
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,than i gave You credit\Nfor got that right make
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,that mistake again and\Nyou'll be dead maybe so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you're like a beast.\NThat savage look in your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,eyes but i can be pretty\Nbeastly myself you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.02,0:03:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For the record i'm the\Nstrongest swordsman in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,all of cp9 this won't\Nbe easy two sword style
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry i use four swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well that's fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your whole body is a weapon, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,72 caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't have time\Nfor fun right now. Shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.10,0:04:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you'd better kill me quickly then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest kick. Slaughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's throwing out everything at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Rastard, are you taking this seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm quite impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.26,0:05:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But you said you were\Nin a hurry, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My new power should\Nspeed things up for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This sure isn't what I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A little gardening is nice and\Nall, but this is way overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like we're outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.56,0:06:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna focus on getting\Nthe key to Robin's handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.16,0:06:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the key and leave a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm Sniper King,\Nbut today, I'm Lucky King too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Itty Betty bit, almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:07:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And Rooster, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.42,0:07:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right there, and the noisiest bird\Nin the whole stinking world shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If he crows, I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That assassin guy will wake\Nup and wipe the floor with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to crow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to crow, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Rooster, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rooster, Master Rooster, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, don't crow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take some time and\Ntake it over, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Chirp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Roosters don't chirp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, rooster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's time to kick your ass, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:07:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the slingshot guy that\Nburned down the flag, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad sniping won't help you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He just woke up from his nap and\Nhe's already hitting that hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.40,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That punch was kinda sloppy. Not my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.58,0:08:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet it hurt, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I look scary, but I'm no sadist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I like my fights clean and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got Devil Fruit powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The dog-dog fruit, model wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just tear out your\Nwindpipe, and that'll be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die anyway, so no\Nneed for you to suffer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Hold on. You sure you\Ndon't look all that tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to intimidate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to save Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm gonna do
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.16,0:09:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trying to use my man beast\Nform, but I messed up on the man part
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,THE CEILING!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power is so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you play some kind of zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oxox fruit! Model giraffe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku, you poor bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:09:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to eat\Nthat fruit, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's so wrong with\Nbeing a giraffe, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For your information, I\Nhappen to like it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That pigeon guy was a leopard, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes three people\Nthat transform into animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean the rest of\NCP9 has powers like that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A wolfman is one thing,\Nbut now a giraffeman, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to\Ndeal with two Zonatimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, now that Zorro's\Nhere, it's two-on-two, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Or more like two-on-one, with this guy\Ncowering in the corner and watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like someone left a safe open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are those weird-looking\Nhandcuffs what I think they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Stop\Nlaughing! Hey, giraffe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.16,0:10:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you zoo animals want to\Nargue, do it on your own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:10:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you just want to stand\Nthere, your neck is an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate the limitless\Ndestructive power of giraffes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my man-beast form.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been reborn with unspeakable power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that is lame! But I... What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I say something so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he does look pretty\Nridiculous, but that's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.22,0:11:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose my composure,\Nhe'll have the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to sit there\Nand laugh all day, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is harder than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he have to be so\Nsquare and funny-looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where did these handcuffs come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Whoops! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,those are probably the same Z-PRISM\Nhandcuffs they put on ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.58,0:12:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemies both have devil\Nfruit powers, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought if I cuffed them,\Nthey'd be easier to beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you put\Nthe handcuffs on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The giraffe guy's face is too funny! My...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,hand slipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.94,0:12:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not square, I'm cool, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all going to pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the power of my\NDevil Fruit, then you'll be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Best kick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.32,0:12:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, boy, he's mad now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky Slicer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Usa, get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.20,0:13:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That long neck has improved your reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.34,0:13:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The centrifugal force\Ncoming from a body that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,size makes for a very fast\Nand very deadly attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.96,0:13:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like\Nhe cut anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Try taking a look at the ceiling. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can see is the sky. The
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,sky but that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.74,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,must mean you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,should be ashamed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,a Professional
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't let his emotions get
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.52,0:14:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the better of it I don't want\Nto hear It anymore for the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time, giraffes are awesome.\NI love giraffes. Fine. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you say man huh you can show\Noff all you want it doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,matter to me I Came here expecting\Na fight your powers don't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.26,0:14:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,scare me one bit okay cut it\Nout Zoro that hurts what are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you doing why are you pulling\Nmy arm like that wait Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.12,0:14:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's not coming off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:14:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear this is not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't tackled me back there,\Nthis never would have happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to get your hat lopped\Noff and you're blaming this on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to get\Nus both killed or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're completely ignoring\Nus. What happened? Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,let's think about This in short\Nwe're in the same situation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,as Robin right right then to\NGet the key we're gonna have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,to fight them and take it so\Nnothing has changed Really being
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,handcuffed to someone is just\Nbusiness as usual then damn I
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.44,0:15:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,guess They're stuck together fine\Nthen it's settled I'll put those
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,two idiots out Of their misery\Nyou stand over here and watch
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.28,0:15:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,what screw you I'm not letting\Nyou steal my prey you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only other option is working\Ntogether, and I know you don't want that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.94,0:15:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys Can you check\Nthe number on those handcuffs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Number?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.71,0:16:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Each pair of handcuffs and each key is\Nmarked with a matching number Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't know which key\Nwe need to use to unlock them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.18,0:16:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate if either of us\Nhave the key to those handcuffs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.52,0:16:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll unlock them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks. Let's see, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, it's number two! Unlock us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not mine either. That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, they don't get\Nour hopes up like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we ran away, it's not like we\Ncould fight the rest of CP9 in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's first come, first kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's only fair. I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.14,0:16:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The stairs are all split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:17:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been that\Nbig rumble I felt earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever's fighting sure must be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys okay in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sniper King!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jumper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waving at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.18,0:17:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck together,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupor. And if you can't find key\Nnumber two, they're going to murder us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:18:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of figured there'd be\Na bridge here or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, those whirlpools are really huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see the Gates of Justice from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know if I\Ncan get there on a boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to stand here and\Nthink. I gotta give it a shot at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it, so the keys and the handcuffs\Nhave matching numbers on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't fight, then that's\Nokay, I didn't find anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can just beat these guys for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but there's no way\Nin hell that's gonna happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.40,0:18:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and besides, if you get taken out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be stuck in these\Nhandcuffs with no way to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.80,0:18:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope. Only hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Flattery doesn't work on me at\Nall you big dummies Between Sanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami and Franky someone has\Nto have the number two key.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.68,0:18:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it and bring it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone has a key\Nalready, it's probably Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.90,0:19:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm their only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've caught you now, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are far too weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no match for him at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron body! Foxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are your punches so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're not human, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cute how you CP9 guys can\Nmake your bodies hard like iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But these fists of mine are\Nthe genuine article, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time for me to be drinking tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Witchcraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.79,0:20:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You put me under a spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,One more sip and I'd be finished! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.10,0:20:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost got captured in your love trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So you say, after three cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.18,0:20:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare play innocent with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten what\Nhappened on the C-train.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive the way\Nyou people treated Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.34,0:20:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, give me your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you're in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I won't keep you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want the key, then take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to search my body\Nand find out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you're up to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You said I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're off to a bad start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that was stupid.
